  "description": "The Backroad FF stands for performance off the tarmac. Aerodynamics, comfort and catering were the top priorities during development – so that you can give your all in the race against yourself or others. Highlights of the Gravel-Race model platform • Gravel Race One-Piece Cockpit – built for speed • Plenty of tyre clearance – up to 45 mm tyre clearance • Integrated power meter – Red XPLR AXS power meter measures your performance • Well thought-out bag concept – magnetic, practical, beautiful • Wolftooth Chainguide – keeps the chain where it belongs The Backroad FF Red AXS XPLR is also equipped with the Red AXS XPLR 1x13 groupset, ROSE G50 wheels and Schwalbe G One RS tyres as well as the Selle Italia Flite Boost Carbon saddle in combination with the ROSE Aero D-Shape seat post. ¹ approx. 7.6 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for frame colour pistachio, size M, without pedals",
